ちゃんの表情は服の交換に慣れていないような、少し恥じらいのある感じだと嬉しいです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@OSNmykk/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f2caece4/uploads/origins/a9a03b51-0900-4557-b832-90a5018db170?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=856452a2afd079c0800d3d47e1bf57be", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f2caece4/uploads/origins/a9a03b51-0900-4557-b832-90a5018db170?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=856452a2afd079c0800d3d47e1bf57be, https://si.imgix.net/f2caece4/uploads/origins/a9a03b51-0900-4557-b832-90a5018db170?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6951fb538ab0b03c9a3405f84ec50e50 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f2caece4/uploads/origins/a9a03b51-0900-4557-b832-90a5018db170?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1864bbccb614d64adbf8a6f05009c920 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\n自分より高いところに座ったサーバルちゃんが裸足の足裏で顔を挟もうとしてきます。このいたずらっ子め。\n\n服はお任せします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@OSNmykk/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/394208fe/uploads/origins/976fed2b-1e74-4a12-9b95-6986fbf0495b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=250cf3408f1e3f79d525603c02416846", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/394208fe/uploads/origins/976fed2b-1e74-4a12-9b95-6986fbf0495b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=250cf3408f1e3f79d525603c02416846, https://si.imgix.net/394208fe/uploads/origins/976fed2b-1e74-4a12-9b95-6986fbf0495b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=503131686eb0b132f8aa7027529dc053 2x, https://si.imgix.net/394208fe/uploads/origins/976fed2b-1e74-4a12-9b95-6986fbf0495b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=261f421892223c1fb46cf6593c27006e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "枚画先生、こんにちは！いつもあなたのかわいい絵が大